The plate is a square side plate, roughly 22 cm across. It holds two bacon pieces, one about 12 cm long and the other about 8 cm long. Cooked bacon slices are typically about 20 cm long when raw and about 12 cm when cooked, so these look like roughly 1 full slice and a partial one, about 1.5 slices in total.

A cooked slice weighs about 8 g and has roughly 45 kcal, so 1.5 slices come to about 12 g and 65 kcal.

